OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fspread across all parts from the west
OL,7,Ffor a time this evening. Then turning
OL,8,Fdrier and clearer during the early
OL,9,Fhours with a few showers. Quite windy
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA windy day with bright
OL,13,Fspells and scattered showers, becoming
OL,14,Fdrier by eveniing. Fresh occasionally
OL,15,Fstrong westerly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,18,Fspreading east for a time on Friday, a
OL,19,Ffew showers following on by evening.
OL,20,FBright and breezy on Saturday with a
OL,21,Ffew showers. Dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
